@startuml UC-03-Melihat-Materi
title Sequence Diagram: Melihat Materi

actor "Users (Learner)" as User
participant "Halaman Daftar\n& Detail Materi\n(React)" as UI
participant "GET /api/materi\nGET /api/materi/:id" as API
participant "MateriController" as Controller
participant "MateriService" as Service
database "PostgreSQL\n(tabel Materi)" as DB
participant "React Markdown" as Markdown

== Fase 1: Melihat Daftar Materi ==

User -> UI: Mengakses halaman\ndaftar materi
activate UI
UI -> API: GET /api/materi
activate API
API -> Controller: getAllMateri()
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: getPublicMateri()
activate Service
Service -> DB: SELECT * FROM Materi\nWHERE status_publik = true\nORDER BY tanggalUnggah DESC
activate DB
DB --> Service: Return array materi\n(id, judul, penulis, rating,\ntotalDilihat, tanggalUnggah)
deactivate DB

alt Ada materi tersedia
    Service --> Controller: { success: true, data: [...materi] }
    Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
    API --> UI: Data materi
    UI --> User: Menampilkan daftar materi\n(judul, penulis, rating, views)
else Tidak ada materi
    Service --> Controller: { success: true, data: [] }
    Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
    API --> UI: Data kosong
    UI --> User: Tampilkan pesan\n"Belum ada materi tersedia"
end

deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API

== Fase 2: Melihat Detail Materi ==

User -> UI: Mengklik judul materi
UI -> API: GET /api/materi/:id
activate API
API -> Controller: getMateriById(id)
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: getMateriDetail(id)
activate Service
Service -> DB: SELECT * FROM Materi\nWHERE idMateri = '[id]'\nAND status_publik = true
activate DB
DB --> Service: Return data materi lengkap\n(kontenMarkdown, dll)
deactivate DB

alt Materi ditemukan
    Service -> DB: UPDATE Materi SET\ntotalDilihat = totalDilihat + 1\nWHERE idMateri = '[id]'
    activate DB
    DB --> Service: Update success
    deactivate DB
    Service --> Controller: { success: true, data: {materi} }
    Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
    API --> UI: Data materi lengkap
    UI -> Markdown: Parse kontenMarkdown ke HTML
    activate Markdown
    Markdown --> UI: Return HTML ter-render
    deactivate Markdown
    UI --> User: Menampilkan halaman detail\ndengan konten lengkap
    User -> User: Membaca materi
else Materi tidak ditemukan
    Service --> Controller: { success: false,\nerror: "Materi tidak ditemukan" }
    Controller --> API: Response 404 Not Found
    API --> UI: Error response
    UI --> User: Tampilkan error message
    UI --> User: Redirect ke daftar materi
end

deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
deactivate UI

== Exception: Markdown Rendering Error ==

note over Markdown
  Jika rendering gagal,
  tampilkan raw text atau
  safe rendering dengan
  warning message
end note

@enduml
